aron and Moses: and the years of the life of Amram were an hundred and thirty and seven years.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ5And the sons of Izhar; Korah, and Nepheg, and Zichri.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ:And the sons of Uzziel; Mishael, and Elzaphan, and Zithri.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙˆAnd Aaron took him Elisheba, daughter of Amminadab, sister of Naashon, to wife; and she bare him Nadab, and Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ`And the sons of Korah; Assir, and Elkanah, and Abiasaph: these are the families of the Korhites.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ²And Eleazar Aaron's son took him one of the daughters of Putiel to wife; and she bare him Phinehas: these are the heads of the fathers of the Levites according to their families.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses’„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ‰These are that Aaron and Moses, to whom the LORD said, Bring out the children of Israel from the land of Egypt according to their armies.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ„These are they which spake to Pharaoh king of Egypt, to bring out the children of Israel from Egypt: these are that Moses and Aaron.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses“„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙSAnd it came to pass on the day when the LORD spake unto Moses in the land of Egypt,¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙvthat the LORD spake unto Moses, saying, I am the LORD: speak thou unto Pharaoh king of Egypt all that I say unto thee.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙjAnd Moses said before the LORD, Behold, I am of uncircumcised lips, and how shall Pharaoh hearken unto me?¦layout ªlast_verse